{q:'What is a strong next sentence?',o:['I decided not to rush into the first opportunity and took time to think about my next step.','I have decided at that moment and took time.','I decide and taked time.'],a:'I decided not to rush into the first opportunity and took time to think about my next step.',h:'Describe your decisions at that finished moment.',e:'Past Simple “decided / took” continues the story.'}
